{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18953","headline":"文宗元圣昭献孝皇帝挽歌三首 三 · 刘禹锡","name":"文宗元圣昭献孝皇帝挽歌三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"享国十五载，升天千万年。\n龙镳仙路远，骑吹礼容全。\n日下初陵外，人悲旧劒前。\n周南有遗老，掩泪望秦川。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18953.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18953","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}